{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちはー。\n \n \n \n \n 令和時代に突入しましたね〜\n 昨日の日付変わる瞬間、\n みんな何してたのー?🤔\n \n \n \n \n \n 未だに、令和って言葉を\n 口に出すのに慣れてなくて\n 妙に恥ずかしくなってしまう、、、🙄\n \n つい1ヶ月前までは\n この世になかった言葉なのに\n もう予測変換に漢字が表記されるし\n 雑誌の見出しでよく見るし\n 世間の適応能力すごい。\n \n \n \n 置いてかれておるなあ。\n \n だけどワクワクするー!\n お正月気分!🎍\n \n \n \n \n \n \n この間言ってた写真載せるね。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXF8AW72HWNR28JSX3QS8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXG6YFJ3X3SERPA442E5N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXH55V9M8PGDC78B208VS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXJ6AE1649GK4D1RPKP5B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXK6R89F7979XHG1AEMKW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXM5AJ6WQR1CEVZH2MQZQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXN439CMZNJMFGHQ8SPEC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNXP437K8BMDH5GN2QY2N4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n かわいい…🤦🏻‍♀️\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 読んでくれてありがとう。\n 長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}